---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About" description="Product designer, creative director, and repeat founder.">
  <section class="about wrap">
    <h1>I'm Andrew.</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a product designer, creative director, and repeat founder. I have a deep interest in finding where craft can
      drive impact and taking nebulous ideas and transforming them into concrete experiences.
    </p>
    <p>I've founded venture-backed startups and taken them from 0→1 to beyond.</p>
    <p>I've led design on apps downloaded by tens of millions of people.</p>
    <p>
      I do my best work when I'm surrounded by curious, thoughtful, honest people. I do my best to exhibit those
      qualities.
    </p>
    <p>Fun fact: I used to compete internationally in Naginata, or Japanese spearfighting.</p>
    <p>
      <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Email me</a>, <a class="text-link" href={site.cv}
        >read my CV</a
      >, or find me on <a class="text-link" href={site.linkedin}>Linkedin</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: calc(760px + 2 * var(--gutter));
    padding-top: clamp(30px, 6vw, 70px);
  }
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
</style>
